      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of existential exhaustion, seeing the sheer weight of existence as an inescapable obligation. That feeling of being trapped in a system you never consented to is a very real and heavy burden to carry. Sometimes, acknowledging that the \"contract\" is fundamentally flawed is the first step toward finding a way to rewrite the terms.",
